self-tests passed (ladder fill carries a stopped restart forward and stays non-decreasing; the registered Richardson band lands on the
analytic limit 0.6 of a geometric ladder with r = 0.4 and is undefined for r <= 0 and r >= 1;
planted collapse of 64x recovered as 63x; the linearity test clears an exact line
and rejects a planted curve)

